{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13707","headline":"弋阳溪中望仙人城 · 顾况","name":"弋阳溪中望仙人城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何草乏灵姿，无山不孤绝。\n我行虽云蹇，偶胜聊换节。\n上界浮中流，光响洞明灭。\n晚禽曝霜羽，寒鱼依石发。\n自有无还心，隔波望松雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}